    {
      "id": "p0212-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Throughout the story so far, Sans has been a friendly, joke-loving goofball. But suddenly, with a terrifying look on his face, he says in a completely different font and tone of voice:",
        "raw": "Throughout the story so far, Sans has been a friendly, joke-loving goofball. But\nsuddenly, with a terrifying look on his face, he says in a completely different\nfont and tone of voice:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
