    {
      "id": "p0212-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby intended this line to emotionally shock the player, as it's the first real time that Sans shows that he has a dark, frightening side. Naturally, Toby considers this scene - and this specific line - very important to the Undertale experience. As such, he was very particular about how this line was handled in translation. After a lot of trial-and-error, Toby and the translation team went with a straightforward approach:",
        "raw": "Toby intended this line to emotionally shock the player, as it's the first real time\nthat Sans shows that he has a dark, frightening side. Naturally, Toby considers\nthis scene - and this specific line - very important to the Undertale experience.\nAs such, he was very particular about how this line was handled in translation.\nAfter a lot of trial-and-error, Toby and the translation team went with a\nstraightforward approach:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29609435,
          0.37554286,
          0.90922593,
          0.47917857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29392643,
          0.37482857,
          0.91127114,
          0.48025
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          19,
          20,
          21,
          22,
          23,
          24
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 希望这句话让玩家受到震动，因为这是 Sans 第一次真正展露黑暗、可怕的一面。因此，他认为这场戏，尤其是这句台词，对《Undertale》的体验非常重要，翻译时也格外讲究。经过多次尝试，Toby 与团队最终选择了直接的处理：",
        "status": "draft",
