    {
      "id": "p0212-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The original English line leaves it unclear why the main character would be dead by now. It's left to the player's interpretation: would Sans have killed the main character himself, would he have captured the main character for the king to kill later, or possibly something else? This Japanese line achieves a similar vagueness through careful wording.",
        "raw": "The original English line leaves it unclear why the main character would be\ndead by now. It's left to the player's interpretation: would Sans have killed the\nmain character himself, would he have captured the main character for the\nking to kill later, or possibly something else? This Japanese line achieves a\nsimilar vagueness through careful wording.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29694311,
          0.53987857,
          0.89665816,
          0.62596429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29392643,
          0.53916429,
          0.91127114,
          0.62703571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          29,
          30,
          31,
          32,
          33
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "英文原句没有说明主角为什么会死，留给玩家自行理解：Sans 会亲手杀死主角，还是抓住主角交给国王杀掉，又或者另有原因？日语通过谨慎措辞，保住了相近的模糊性。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
