    {
      "id": "p0212-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "After the official translation's release, Japanese players indeed found this scene shocking, and the vagueness of the translated line left players with different interpretations. Given this, there's no doubt that Toby's persistence with this line led to a superior, more faithful translation in the end.",
        "raw": "After the official translation's release, Japanese players indeed found this scene\nshocking, and the vagueness of the translated line left players with different\ninterpretations. Given this, there's no doubt that Toby's persistence with this\nline led to a superior, more faithful translation in the end.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29657497,
          0.64110714,
          0.90652626,
          0.70896429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29392643,
          0.64039286,
          0.91127114,
          0.71003571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          34,
          35,
          36,
          37
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "官方译版发行后，日本玩家确实被这一幕震住了，模糊的台词也引发了不同解读。由此可见，Toby 对这句话的坚持，最终带来了更出色、更忠实的翻译。",
